@startuml Log Records Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Log records — administrative query and deletion

actor Admin
participant "JWT + Admin guards" as Guards
participant LogRecordsController as Controller
participant "Get / Delete LogRecordsService" as Service
participant LogStorageProvider as Storage
database "AWS DynamoDB\nlog records" as DynamoDB

Admin -> Guards : GET or DELETE /log-records/{stream}
Guards -> Controller : authorized request
Controller -> Service : validated range, page and filters

alt Storage mode is file
  Service --> Admin : 409 LOG_9101
else Storage mode is DynamoDB
  Service -> Storage : query or delete observability/audit records
  Storage -> DynamoDB : Query / BatchWriteItem
  DynamoDB --> Storage : items / deletion result
  Storage --> Service : records, total or deleted count
  Service -> Service : map allowlisted response fields
  Service --> Admin : paginated DTO, 204 or deleted count
end

note over Controller, Service
  Query ranges are mandatory and limited to 31 days.
  Deleting audit roots also deletes their audit_repeat records.
end note
@enduml
